The bowler should have tactical tools to challenge:
- A batter who repeatedly targets leg side.
- A batter who advances early.
- A batter who plays cross-bat shots too frequently.
- A batter who struggles against swing.
- A batter who struggles against spin or changes of pace.

Do not give the bowler hidden unfair assistance.

