This is one of the most important missing systems.

The game must have genuine fielding consequences.

The AI fielders must stop boundaries, create catching opportunities, collect the ball, throw to the stumps and influence whether batters can run.

## 8.1 Fielder positioning

Support common cricket positions:

- Wicketkeeper.
- Slips.
- Gully.
- Point.
